  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voices of Creativity: Empowering Youth and Community through Art and Education. A project consisting of different workshops and expositions.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The multifaceted engagement project aims to foster cultural exchange and community empowerment in collaboration with local partners. The activities are designed to enhance cultural exchange and creativity. The primary goal is to foster through workshops cultural links between Cote D&apos;ivoire and the Netherlands. In each city, the objective is to engage the public in creative projects that reflect both the local culture and the Netherlands&apos; contribution to the art
world. This includes teaching about key figures from Dutch art history through projection lectures.
Through a diverse range of activities, including photography workshops, artistic installations, and educational initiatives, the project creates meaningful connections and opportunities for
growth. This project celebrates the rich artistic heritage of the Ivory Coast while promoting dialogue, skill development, and creativity among youth and communities.</narrative>
  </description>
